## The short version

You are holding TRA-3048/TRA-3050 off production to protect the TRA-2956 grade. **What the release now lands is no longer what you held.** `origin/main` has moved to `c44b4e49`, **thirty commits** past `eca40a2`, and `scripts/render-redeploy.mjs` `resolveTarget` takes the branch tip -- so TRA-3053's release deploys all thirty.

One of them changes a function this grade attributes its result to.

